gmeow:thrGroundingExemplified a gmeow:AxisThreshold ; rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/slice-quality-rubric> ; rdfs:label "grounding floor — Exemplified"@x-gmeow-english ; skos:definition "The grounding-axis score floor to earn the Exemplified tier."@x-gmeow-english ; gmeow:graphBoxRole gmeow:boxABox ; gmeow:thresholdTier gmeow:tierExemplified ; gmeow:thresholdFloor 0.85 .
gmeow:thrGroundingMaximal a gmeow:AxisThreshold ; rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/slice-quality-rubric> ; rdfs:label "grounding floor — Maximal"@x-gmeow-english ; skos:definition "The grounding-axis score floor to earn the Maximal tier."@x-gmeow-english ; gmeow:graphBoxRole gmeow:boxABox ; gmeow:thresholdTier gmeow:tierMaximal ; gmeow:thresholdFloor 0.95 .

