# The flagship-counter-example-depth floors are ALL 0.0 — an advisory, not-yet-gated
# axis: it scores and advises but every tier is reachable at any score, so it never
# caps the roll-up meet and cannot drop a slice's ratchet tier. The 0.0 floors are a
# not-yet-gated POLICY, NOT score calibration (the score is an objective intrinsic
# fraction); the axis surfaces the reasoner-depth opportunity without forcing the work.
gmeow:thrFlagshipDepthRegistered a gmeow:AxisThreshold ; rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/slice-quality-rubric> ; rdfs:label "flagship-depth floor — Registered"@x-gmeow-english ; skos:definition "The flagship-counter-example-depth-axis score floor to earn the Registered tier — 0.0, the advisory-only not-yet-gated policy."@x-gmeow-english ; gmeow:graphBoxRole gmeow:boxABox ; gmeow:thresholdTier gmeow:tierRegistered ; gmeow:thresholdFloor 0.0 .
