#################################################################
# Committed floor commitments (ontology-resident, gate-enforced)
#
# The canonical, ontology-resident home of the per-slice quality
# floors the make-check slice-quality gate enforces as raise-only
# monotonic ratchets. Each gmeow:AxisFloorCommitment pins one
# (slice, axis) measured-score floor; each gmeow:SliceTierFloor pins
# one slice's roll-up tier floor. Values are the historically
# committed floors, transcribed byte-exact. Sorted by slice, then axis.
#################################################################

# --- Per-axis measured-score floors (gmeow:AxisFloorCommitment) ---
